    "手機與手錶上的簡報遙控是 Presence Remote 的付費功能（Presence Pro）；Mac 上的 Presence 一樣免費。": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Präsentationssteuerung auf iPhone und Apple Watch ist eine kostenpflichtige Funktion von Presence Remote (Presence Pro). Presence für den Mac bleibt kostenlos."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presenter Remote on iPhone and Apple Watch is a paid feature of Presence Remote (Presence Pro). Presence for Mac stays free."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El mando de presentaciones en el iPhone y el Apple Watch es una función de pago de Presence Remote (Presence Pro). Presence para Mac sigue siendo gratis."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La télécommande de présentation sur iPhone et Apple Watch est une fonction payante de Presence Remote (Presence Pro). Presence pour Mac reste gratuit."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhoneとApple Watchでのプレゼンリモコンは、Presence Remoteの有料機能（Presence Pro）です。MacのPresenceは引き続き無料です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 및 Apple Watch의 프레젠테이션 리모컨은 Presence Remote의 유료 기능(Presence Pro)입니다. Mac의 Presence는 계속 무료입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手机与手表上的演示遥控是 Presence Remote 的付费功能（Presence Pro）；Mac 上的 Presence 依然免费。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手機與手錶上的簡報遙控是 Presence Remote 的付費功能（Presence Pro）；Mac 上的 Presence 一樣免費。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打開 Presence…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence öffnen …"
          }
        },
        "en": {
