    "綠色虛線是解鎖門檻，橘色虛線是鎖定門檻。": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die grün gestrichelte Linie ist die Entsperrschwelle, die orange die Sperrschwelle."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The green dashed line is the unlock threshold; the orange one is the lock threshold."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La línea discontinua verde es el umbral de desbloqueo, y la naranja, el de bloqueo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le pointillé vert indique le seuil de déverrouillage, le pointillé orange celui de verrouillage."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "緑の破線はロック解除のしきい値、オレンジの破線はロックのしきい値です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "녹색 점선은 잠금 해제 임계값, 주황색 점선은 잠금 임계값입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绿色虚线是解锁阈值，橙色虚线是锁定阈值。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "綠色虛線是解鎖門檻，橘色虛線是鎖定門檻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
